{
 "source": "W3C WebAuthn Level 3, section 16 Test Vectors (stated non-normative by the spec)",
 "spec": "https://www.w3.org/TR/2026/REC-webauthn-3-20260825/",
 "normative": false,
 "sections": [
  {
   "section": "16.17",
   "title": "Test Vectors for WebAuthn Extensions",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "prose": "This section lists example values for WebAuthn extensions."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "section": "16.17.1",
   "title": "Pseudo-random function extension (prf)",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "prose": "This section lists example values for the pseudo-random function (prf) extension."
    },
    {
     "prose": "Because the prf extension integrates with the CTAP2 hmac-secret extension [FIDO-CTAP], the examples are divided into two sections: example inputs and outputs for the WebAuthn prf extension, relevant to WebAuthn Clients and WebAuthn Relying Parties; and example mappings between the WebAuthn prf extension and the CTAP2 hmac-secret extension, relevant to WebAuthn Clients and WebAuthn Authenticator."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "section": "16.17.1.1",
   "title": "Web Authentication API",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "prose": "The following examples may be used to test WebAuthn Client implementations of and WebAuthn Relying Party usage of the prf extension. The examples are not exhaustive."
    },
    {
     "prose": "The enabled output is always present during registration ceremonies, and never present during authentication ceremonies:"
    },
    {
     "pre": [
      {
       "text": "// Example extension inputs:"
      },
      {
       "text": "{ prf: {} }"
      },
      {
       "text": "// Example client extension outputs from navigator.credentials.create():"
      },
      {
       "text": "{ prf: { enabled: true } }"
      },
      {
       "text": "{ prf: { enabled: false } }"
      },
      {
       "text": "// Example client extension outputs from navigator.credentials.get():"
      },
      {
       "text": "{ prf: {} }"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "prose": "The results output may be present during registration ceremonies or authentication ceremonies if the eval or evalByCredential input is present:"
    },
    {
     "pre": [
      {
       "text": "// Example extension inputs:"
      },
      {
       "text": "{ prf: { eval: { first: new Uint8Array([1, 2, 3, 4]) } } }"
      },
      {
       "text": "// Example client extension outputs from navigator.credentials.create():"
      },
      {
       "text": "{ prf: { enabled: true } }"
      },
      {
       "text": "{ prf: { enabled: false } }"
      },
      {
       "text": "{ prf: { enabled: true, results: { first: ArrayBuffer } } }"
      },
      {
       "text": "// Example client extension outputs from navigator.credentials.get():"
      },
      {
       "text": "{ prf: {} }"
      },
      {
       "text": "{ prf: { results: { first: ArrayBuffer } } }"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "prose": "The results.second output is present if and only if the results output is present and the second input was present in the chosen PRF inputs:"
    },
    {
     "pre": [
      {
       "text": "// Example extension inputs:"
      },
      {
       "text": "{"
      },
      {
       "text": "  prf: {"
      },
      {
       "text": "    eval: {"
      },
      {
       "text": "      first: new Uint8Array([1, 2, 3, 4]),"
      },
      {
       "text": "      second: new Uint8Array([5, 6, 7, 8]),"
      },
      {
       "text": "    },"
      },
      {
       "text": "    evalByCredential: {"
      },
      {
       "text": "      \"e02eZ9lPp0UdkF4vGRO4-NxlhWBkL1FCmsmb1tTfRyE\": {"
      },
      {
       "text": "        first: new Uint8Array([9, 10, 11, 12]),"
      },
      {
       "text": "      }"
      },
      {
       "text": "    }"
      },
      {
       "text": "  }"
      },
      {
       "text": "}"
      },
      {
       "text": "// Example client extension outputs from navigator.credentials.get() if credential \"e02eZ9lP...\" was used:"
      },
      {
       "text": "{ prf: { results: { first: ArrayBuffer } } }"
      },
      {
       "text": "// Example client extension outputs from navigator.credentials.get() if a different credential was used:"
      },
      {
       "text": "{ prf: {} }"
      },
      {
       "text": "{ prf: { results: { first: ArrayBuffer, second: ArrayBuffer } } }"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "prose": "The first and second outputs may be any BufferSource type. Equal first and second inputs result in equal first and second outputs:"
    },
    {
     "pre": [
      {
       "text": "// Example extension inputs:"
      },
      {
       "text": "{"
      },
      {
       "text": "  prf: {"
      },
      {
       "text": "    evalByCredential: {"
      },
      {
       "text": "      \"e02eZ9lPp0UdkF4vGRO4-NxlhWBkL1FCmsmb1tTfRyE\": {"
      },
      {
       "text": "        first: new Uint8Array([9, 10, 11, 12]),"
      },
      {
       "text": "        second: new Uint8Array([9, 10, 11, 12])"
      },
      {
       "text": "      }"
      },
      {
       "text": "    }"
      },
      {
       "text": "  }"
      },
      {
       "text": "}"
      },
      {
       "text": "// Example client extension outputs from navigator.credentials.get():"
      },
      {
       "text": "{"
      },
      {
       "text": "  prf: {"
      },
      {
       "text": "    results: {"
      },
      {
       "text": "      first: new Uint8Array([0xc4, 0x17, 0x2e, 0x98, 0x2e, 0x90, 0x97, 0xc3, 0x9a, 0x6c, 0x0c, 0xb7, 0x20, 0xcb, 0x37, 0x5b, 0x92, 0xe3, 0xfc, 0xad, 0x15, 0x4a, 0x63, 0xe4, 0x3a, 0x93, 0xf1, 0x09, 0x6b, 0x1e, 0x19, 0x73]),"
      },
      {
       "text": "      second: new Uint32Array([0x982e17c4, 0xc397902e, 0xb70c6c9a, 0x5b37cb20, 0xadfce392, 0xe4634a15, 0x09f1933a, 0x73191e6b]),"
      },
      {
       "text": "    }"
      },
      {
       "text": "  }"
      },
      {
       "text": "}"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "prose": "Pseudo-random values used in this section were generated as follows:"
    },
    {
     "prose": "\"e02eZ9lPp0UdkF4vGRO4-NxlhWBkL1FCmsmb1tTfRyE\" = Base64Url(SHA-256(UTF-8(\"WebAuthn PRF test vectors\") || 0x00))"
    },
    {
     "prose": "h'c4172e982e9097c39a6c0cb720cb375b92e3fcad154a63e43a93f1096b1e1973' = SHA-256(UTF-8(\"WebAuthn PRF test vectors\") || 0x01)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
